        "text": "Step 4: Expand the numerator and the denominator:\n\nNumerator: $(-3+4i)(1-2i) = -3 + 6i + 4i - 8i^2 = -3 + 10i + 8 = 5 + 10i$ (since $i^2 = -1$)\n\nDenominator: $(1+2i)(1-2i) = 1 - 4i^2 = 1 + 4 = 5$ (since $i^2 = -1$)"
